function text=certificateAcceptanceContext()
% Shared English scope explanation for measured and numerical certificates.
text=" Selected comparison limits may remain unmet. A physical print-system limitation must be supported by evidence; numerical convergence or an unresolved inverse alone does not establish the cause. Paper white, attainable black and chroma may constrain reproduction. Unmet applicable requirements remain unmet even when their cause is understood. User approval applies only to the stated intended use and accepted limitations; it does not waive a standard requirement or establish conformity. If conformity is required and the applicable requirements are not met, the result must not be approved for that purpose. Read all assessed colours and the disclosed difficult-colour groups, rather than judging only the largest deviations or the overall average. Historical measurements do not verify a newly built profile.";
end
